{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02519","headline":"陇头水 · 杨师道","name":"陇头水","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"陇头秋月明，陇水带关城。\n笳添离别曲，风送断肠声。\n映雪峰犹暗，乘冰马屡惊。\n雾中寒雁至，沙上转蓬轻。\n天山传羽檄，汉地急徵兵。\n阵开都护道，劒聚伏波营。\n於兹觉无渡，方共濯胡缨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨师道","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02519.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02519","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}